        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777000/extras/c738b4d555f3cc4be12ff09f517c3d12.poster.avif?t=1765226757\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777000/extras/c738b4d555f3cc4be12ff09f517c3d12.webm?t=1765226757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777000/extras/c738b4d555f3cc4be12ff09f517c3d12.mp4?t=1765226757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><br>Letters of War</strong> is a heartfelt 2D adventure that tells a touching story of loss, courage and great love. Based on the true story of the developer's grandmother, the game invites you into the world of Liam, a British carpenter who volunteered to go to the front to protect his family.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777000/extras/3fca19c3a7050dc0b3f91d0d5ddafa50.poster.avif?t=1765226757\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777000/extras/3fca19c3a7050dc0b3f91d0d5ddafa50.webm?t=1765226757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777000/extras/3fca19c3a7050dc0b3f91d0d5ddafa50.mp4?t=1765226757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br> Become a participant in the most important battles of the Western Front of World War II - from mainland Italy, the mountain passes of Monte Cassino to Sword Beach (Normandy) - and go all the way as a soldier of the 8th British Army, whose merits have never been covered in such detail. At home, little Rosie is waiting for you - Liam's daughter, to whom you promised to return and who copes with loneliness in the rear with the help of her father's letters and the support of her mother.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777000/extras/241cace6d3a0ca5f8e7df7de5722d54f.poster.avif?t=1765226757\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777000/extras/241cace6d3a0ca5f8e7df7de5722d54f.webm?t=1765226757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777000/extras/241cace6d3a0ca5f8e7df7de5722d54f.mp4?t=1765226757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777000/extras/c738b4d555f3cc4be12ff09f517c3d12.poster.avif?t=1765226757\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777000/extras/c738b4d555f3cc4be12ff09f517c3d12.webm?t=1765226757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777000/extras/c738b4d555f3cc4be12ff09f517c3d12.mp4?t=1765226757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><br>Letters of War</strong> is a heartfelt 2D adventure that tells a touching story of loss, courage and great love. Based on the true story of the developer's grandmother, the game invites you into the world of Liam, a British carpenter who volunteered to go to the front to protect his family.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777000/extras/3fca19c3a7050dc0b3f91d0d5ddafa50.poster.avif?t=1765226757\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777000/extras/3fca19c3a7050dc0b3f91d0d5ddafa50.webm?t=1765226757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777000/extras/3fca19c3a7050dc0b3f91d0d5ddafa50.mp4?t=1765226757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br> Become a participant in the most important battles of the Western Front of World War II - from mainland Italy, the mountain passes of Monte Cassino to Sword Beach (Normandy) - and go all the way as a soldier of the 8th British Army, whose merits have never been covered in such detail. At home, little Rosie is waiting for you - Liam's daughter, to whom you promised to return and who copes with loneliness in the rear with the help of her father's letters and the support of her mother.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777000/extras/241cace6d3a0ca5f8e7df7de5722d54f.poster.avif?t=1765226757\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777000/extras/241cace6d3a0ca5f8e7df7de5722d54f.webm?t=1765226757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777000/extras/241cace6d3a0ca5f8e7df7de5722d54f.mp4?t=1765226757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
